sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Handler (Connection)
  participant R as Reactor (EventLoop)
  participant K as Kernel (epoll/kqueue)
  H->>R: register_io(fd, kReadable, cb)
  R->>K: add fd to interest set
  loop run()
    R->>K: wait for readiness
    K-->>R: fd is readable
    R->>H: cb(fd, kReadable)
    H->>K: read(fd) (non-blocking, may be partial)
    K-->>H: bytes
  end
